
DialogID_75701=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You should first go see Senior Brother Cao Yi'an. He is in charge of all the affairs of Kunlun on a daily basis.</font>
DialogID_75702=
DialogID_75703=<font face="Default" color="#e51433" >（Take out a bottle from the pocket）</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I see, you can take it.</font>
DialogID_75704=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This is... Golden Wound Medicine? You are considerate, a small injury is not a problem.</font>
DialogID_75706=<font face="Default" color="#f9094d" >(Struggled to reach you and dropped a jade pendant at your feet)</font>
DialogID_75707=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Tiger Roaring Villa is heavily guarded. We won't be able to spy on it secretly, so we'll have to force our way in. </font>
DialogID_75709=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >According to your description, this secret medicine can only be used by us. Hurry and report to the headmaster!</font>
DialogID_75711=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Senior brother, don't blame me for everything. It was those people...they poisoned me. If I didn't listen to them, I would end up like Senior Brother Lu, sob...</font>
DialogID_75712=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The master has a deep plan and has divided the dragon vein map into two parts many years ago. I have half of the map here, so please keep it carefully. The other half is with Brother Wuwei, so go and ask him for it. Don't worry, he will not give you a hard time when he sees that you have half of my map.</font>
DialogID_75713=<font face="Default" color="#ff020a" >（Upon hearing your purpose, carefully examine for a moment）</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >is another half of the map,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >and when combined with the one in your hand</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, you will be able to discover hidden markings on the map</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I believe the leader should be somewhere in the map. There is no time to waste,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >you</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >should hurry and set off.</font>
DialogID_75716=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You speak so eloquently, how can I trust you?</font>
DialogID_75719=<font face="Default" color="#fc050d" >(This hidden compartment matches the shape of the jade pendant, it must be the mechanism that the master mentioned)</font>
DialogID_75728=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >There is nothing to do here, you can report back.</font>
DialogID_75729=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It is calm and peaceful here, you can report back</font>
DialogID_75730=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >There are no suspicious individuals here, you can report back</font>
DialogID_75722=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I am Yuan Chen of the Kunlun Sect, I have heard that the Tianya Haige is reclusive here and have come to pay a visit.</font>
DialogID_75723=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >What is it?</font>
DialogID_75724=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Years ago, my friend and I went to Kunlun to play and encountered an avalanche. Fortunately, the master Yun came to our rescue. The three of us became close and swore to be sworn brothers under the moon. Learning the martial arts of the Kunlun sect can also provide additional self-protection, but it requires the approval of the head of the Kunlun sect. You should go to the Kunlun sect to meet the head Yunyangzi and ask about this matter.</font>
DialogID_75725=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thinking back to the coincidence of saving the master of the secluded pavilion and becoming brothers with him, it is still vivid in my mind. It is also possible to teach the martial arts of the Kunlun sect to improve the strength of the disciples of Tianya Haige. Since Yuanchen is visiting Tianya Haige, let him teach you.</font>
DialogID_75726=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Since the head of the Yunyangzi agrees, I have no objections. You should go and talk to Yuanchen.</font>
DialogID_75727=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Since both the head and the master of the secluded pavilion think this is feasible, I will no longer refuse and will teach you the martial arts of the Kunlun sect.</font>
QiecuoMenu_75701=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >So be careful, senior brother.</font>
QiecuoMenu_75704=<font face="Default" color="#ff0010" >(What is he muttering about? I can't understand at all. Oh no, he's coming towards me. I'll have to subdue him first...) </font>
QiecuoMenu_75706=<font face="Default" color="#d81139" >(It's you...)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Junior brother, have you forgotten the first rule of Kunlun Sect, "united we stand, divided we fall"? We are not supposed to fight each other!</font>
QiecuoTitle_75701=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Huh?</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Did senior brother send you here?</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Don't worry, use all your skills, I won't harm you.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Ah...ahh...ahhh...</font>
QiecuoTitle_75704=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Ah…Ah ah…ah…ah...</font>
QiecuoTitle_75706=<font face="Default" color="#fc0019" >（sinister smile）</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Senior Brother, let's not speak in code. I heard that you have the Dragon Vein Map in your hands. I suggest you hand it over, otherwise, don't blame me for being merciless with my sword!</font>
SubmitNpcEx_75701=Greetings to the Sect Leader <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_kl_001" style="HLStype1">Yunyangzi</a>, requesting to join the Kunlun Sect.
