SubmitNpcEx_75733=Go to Xiake Island and find <a href="findnpc_new,scene17,NpcCloneshopkunlun_fc" style="HLStype1">Zhao Wuji (Disciple for Passing on Skills)</a> to learn the sect's unique skills.
