SubmitNpcEx_75751=Visit the Sect Leader of Kunlun, <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_kl_001" style="HLStype1">Yunyangzi</a>, and express the desire to learn the martial arts of Kunlun Sect.
SubmitNpcEx_75752=The head of the Kunlun Sect, Yunyangzi, has agreed to teach martial arts. Quickly return to the Tianya Haige and report to the head of the pavilion, <a href="findnpc_new,school25,newmp_tyhg_001" style="HLStype1">Youyou Jun</a>.
