interactinfo_75732=Follow <a href="findnpc_new,school25,npcmp_lzy_tyhg_drrc_004" style="HLStype1">Huo Sheng</a> to practice Dream Brush Manual and become familiar with martial arts.
okmenu_75701=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, Master</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, I take my leave.</font>
okmenu_75703=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you, Master Uncle,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > I take my leave.</font>
okmenu_75704=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Regardless, it was my momentary desire for victory that caused this, thank you, Senior Brother, for not blaming me.</font>
okmenu_75706=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Brother Lu...</font><font face="Default" color="#f90421" > (secretly hiding the jade pendant)</font>
okmenu_75707=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >If so, I will have a try.</font>
okmenu_75709=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I will go and report to the sect leader.</font>
okmenu_75711=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Please keep these words for the seniors to speak.</font>
okmenu_75712=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I understand.</font>
okmenu_75713=<font face="Default" color="#ff0008" >(When two maps are put together, it is found that the marked places are winding and present a shape of a flying dragon)</font>
okmenu_75716=<font face="Default" color="#e5163c" >(Take out the "Dragon Vein Map")</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Please take a look.</font>
okmenu_75719=<font face="Default" color="#ff020a" >(Put the jade pendant in and try)</font>
okmenu_75728=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you for your hard work, senior brother. I will take my leave.</font>
okmenu_75729=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >That's good, thank you for your hard work, senior brother.</font>
okmenu_75730=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you for your hard work, senior brother. I will take my leave.</font>
okmenu_75722=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >So you are the Senior Brother from Kunlun Sect, I will go and inform the Sect Leader.</font>
okmenu_75723=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The Kunlun Sect's Yuan Chen visits Tianya Haige, and I have long been fascinated by the martial arts of the Kunlun Sect. I hope to learn from them. Do you think this is feasible?</font>
okmenu_75724=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you, master, for your help. I will immediately set off to visit the head of the Kunlun Sect, Yun Yangzi.</font>
okmenu_75725=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you, Master Yun, for your help.</font>
okmenu_75726=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you. I will go to her now.</font>
okmenu_75727=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > I am ready.</font>
story_75701_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The Kunlun Sect advocates for the natural order of the world and respects both heaven and humanity. As the Book of Changes says, "The formless is called the Tao, the formed is called the vessel." What is your view on martial arts?</font>
story_75701_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Remaining calm or having a calm mind, having a true self. Without a mind, there is no heart, without a self, both are the highest realms. I never expected that at such a young age, you could comprehend such profound truths.</font><font face="Default" color="#fc021b" >(I wonder, in all these years, besides that person, has anyone else reached such a level of understanding in enlightenment...)</font>
story_75701_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The Book of Changes often speaks of staying on the right path,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >but I wonder, what do you consider to be the right path in this world?</font>
story_75701_4=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Not bad, since the establishment of Kunlun Sect,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >we have stood for humanity and upheld the great way.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Kunlun Sect follows the motto of "guarding Kunlun, protecting the dry dragon, and ensuring the eternal stability of China". As a disciple of Kunlun Sect, one must not only be a chivalrous knight, but also bear the sacred mission of guarding Kunlun Mountain.</font>
story_75702_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You came at the right time,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I am currently evaluating the recent progress of our disciples in martial arts. You may want to spar with other senior brothers and sisters.</font>
story_75703_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Although you started late, your talent is exceptional.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It's inevitable to make mistakes in sparring, don't worry about it.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Go to Master Gu Chenzi's place and get some medicine for Junior Qing.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >That's all you need to do.</font>
story_75704_1=<font face="Default" color="#ea1c3b" >(Looking at you with a hint of doubt)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Young one, do you need something from me?</font>
story_75704_2=<font face="Default" color="#e81037" >(Stroking his beard, calmly smiling)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Why bully a younger junior with a leg injury... You might go ask him yourself.</font>
story_75705_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Ahem... Thank you for your concern, but you have misunderstood. My leg is a chronic condition that is difficult to treat, but my master has never given up on me... His harsh methods are actually a special treatment, and after two months, there have been some improvements.</font>
story_75706_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It doesn't matter, whether strong or weak, speaking with righteousness, you are truly worthy of being a disciple of Kunlun!</font>
story_75707_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Oh, why do you say that?</font>
story_75707_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You may not know, but Shao Yang's leg was injured by our former senior brother, Lu Jiaping. He was once the most favored disciple of our sect's leader, but ten years ago, he was expelled from the sect due to hurting fellow disciples and has since disappeared...</font>
story_75707_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Brother Lu is highly skilled in martial arts, and all the tasks he has performed in the past are the most difficult and highly confidential ones in our sect. One day, shortly after he returned to the sect, he seemed to have lost his mind and went into a frenzy. Brother Shaoyang, who was closest to him, tried to stop him from harming himself, but... Senior Gu Chenzi was nearby, but he was unable to stop him in time, and has been feeling guilty ever since.</font>
story_75708_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Oh no! A group of people from the Ruined Valley have come to the mountain gate, and they are very aggressive.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > We don't have enough people to handle them.</font>
story_75709_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Where did this inexperienced kid come from? Go cool off somewhere else and bring someone who can talk! I want to ask Master Yunyang, how do you account for the fact that three of the top ten villains were injured by your Kunlun disciples?</font>
story_75709_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Ugh! Stop preaching about righteousness and morality to me!</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I despise the fake gentlemen of your Kunlun sect the most! Especially that old man Yunyangzi, go call him out and ask if he taught a precious disciple, Lu Jiaping, to betray Kunlun.</font>
story_75710_1=<font face="Default" color="#ff0a22" >(A hint of panic in his eyes)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You...saw everything? Please don't tell anyone, the person who just came... </font>
story_75710_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >He...is my father, Huamoxun. He was promiscuous when he was young and drove away my mother, then disappeared without a trace. My aunt was afraid of me staying in the Ruined Valley and tarnishing my reputation, so she sent me to Kunlun sect. It's been ten years, and suddenly my father appeared, I...</font>
story_75710_3=<font face="Default" color="#e51647" >(with a sad expression)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >My father committed many wrongdoings in the past, and now he is trying to make up for his sins. Currently, he urgently needs the Mingxin Pill to save his life, but my master does not believe him. If I were to ask for the pill without caution, it would surely arouse my master's suspicion...</font>
story_75710_4=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Do you... believe me? Are you willing to help me?</font>
story_75711_1=<font face="Default" color="#ff020a" >(looking at you cautiously)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It's you! I remember you, how did you find your way here? What is your purpose?</font>
story_75711_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >So you have good intentions... I apologize for misunderstanding you. I have one more request, do you happen to know the three medicinal ingredients: Fushen, Bingpian, and Subaihe? Besides the Mingxin Pill, these three ingredients are also necessary for the person I want to save.</font>
story_75713_1=<font face="Default" color="#f9070f" >(gazing sadly)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Alas, do you know who is in front of you?</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >He is your Kunlun sect's senior brother who went missing years ago</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Lu Jiaping</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >!</font>
story_75713_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Absolutely not! Do not disturb this matter</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master Yunyang</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >! </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I believe you also know that your senior brother left Kunlun in rebellion. Returning to Kunlun sect in such a miserable state, let's not even mention whether Master Yunyang will save him or not</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Jiaping probably would rather die than be saved. In fact, Jiaping's current state is all because of me, in the end, it's my fault!</font>
story_75713_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Jiaping is a person of integrity and honesty, and he didn't mind my background when we became friends. The two of us have traveled together for several months. As a top disciple of Kunlun sect, he was supposed to be the next leader, but because he accidentally revealed the secret of Kunlun's dragon veins while drunk,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >he ended up in such a situation... It's my fault! It's all my fault!</font>
story_75713_4=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You probably already know that Kunlun Mountain is known as the ancestor of ten thousand ancestors and the origin of dragon veins. For hundreds of years, disciples of the Kunlun sect have shouldered the responsibility of protecting the dragon veins in order to maintain peace and stability in the country. However, the ambitious foreign forces have never stopped their evil intentions of cutting off the dragon veins of China. </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >These Japanese have repeatedly infiltrated Kunlun to conduct surveys, </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >attempting</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > to destroy the dragon veins and seize the treasures.</font>
story_75713_5=<font face="Default" color="#e5204e" >（sadness）</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I was afraid of death and made a mistake, revealing this matter to the Japanese... Soon after, Jiaping was ambushed by the Japanese while on a mission. They poisoned him with a strange poison, using it to blackmail him into giving them the key to open the dragon veins. If he couldn't get the antidote within three days, he would become a mindless zombie... Jiaping didn't want to involve his </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >school</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, and planned to quietly leave Kunlun to say goodbye to everyone</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, but the poison acted too quickly and affected his dear friend. He felt ashamed to face everyone, </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >so he refused to explain and let the head of the school expel him from Kunlun...</font>
story_75713_6=Later, he truly became a zombie. Even though he was crazy and out of control, he always maintained a bit of clarity. No matter how the Japanese tortured him, he refused to reveal the secret of the dragon veins. Later, I took advantage of their unpreparedness and rescued him...
story_75713_7=(in extreme pain, tears seem to be in the corners of his eyes) If it weren't for my greed for alcohol and women, not listening to Jia Ping's advice, how could I have been seduced by the Japanese demon woman... She must have known about my friendship with Jia Ping and set up a trap!
story_75713_8=In the end, it's my fault! I betrayed my brother out of fear for my own life! These years, I have been running around and trying everything, but I still couldn't make him sober, I...
story_75713_9=
story_75714_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I didn't expect the Japanese to follow me</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It seems that it's not safe to stay here for long. Jia Ping and I need to find a new hiding place.</font>
story_75715_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >We received information from Wudang a few days ago, saying that there were frequent abnormal activities in Tiger Roaring Villa, and we hope each School is keeping an eye on this.</font>
story_75715_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The issue this time is not trivial. Sage Ziyang of Wudang sent a message that there are people from Xixia First Class Hall currently in Tiger Roaring Villa. Go to the Tiger Roaring Villa, and investigate the issue!</font>
story_75716_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Many years ago, a mysterious assassin appeared in Jianghu. This person's name was Zhao Ziji and his martial arts skills were exceptional. He managed to kill several of Kunlun disciples. Despite sending out many skilled fighters, we were only able to injure him and he still managed to escape.</font>
story_75716_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Zhao Ziji was badly injured, so we thought he must be dead. For so many years, there was not any news about him. I didn't expect to hear that he appears again in Suzhou. Go to Suzhou and collect information.</font>
story_75717_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Zhao Ziji? What a coincidence. A couple of days ago, many men came here looking for Zhao Ziji. Is he the one you're talking about? </font>
story_75717_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Zhao Ziji has been living in Twilight Village. If all those who want revenge on him go there, there will be great unrest.</font>
story_75718_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >If the Han family in Xishan is really involved, then this Zhao Ziji must be one of their people. However, with the Han family's protection, it will be difficult for my Kunlun sect to eliminate Zhao Ziji.</font>
story_75718_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You must quickly go to the village of Twilight and make sure that the enemy of Kunlun does not die at the hands of others. If anyone tries to stop you, kill them. As long as you can personally kill Zhao Ziji, I will surely reward you greatly!</font>
story_75719_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Recently, the news of the butterfly murders near Luoyang has been spreading, and all major martial arts sects have been investigating, but it is unlikely that they will find anything.</font>
story_75719_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Hmph! This butterfly killing technique is probably someone using a secret medicine to control the butterflies and spread an unknown poison. Now I want to send you to the vicinity of Qingyun Castle to see if you can find any clues. However, we still don't know how poisonous these butterflies are. It's very dangerous to go there, so you must be careful.</font>
story_75720_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Since Elder Wang has given such instructions, this secret medicine must be extremely important. However, it may not be easy to control it in the hands of my Kunlun Sect.</font>
story_75720_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You must immediately go to Qingyun Castle and find out who has this secret medicine. No matter what methods you use, you must bring back this secret medicine!</font>
story_75721_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master...he's injured and in seclusion.</font>
story_75721_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The injuries are not serious,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >but</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >he needs to rest.</font>
story_75721_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Although Cao Yi'an is considered the new successor of Kunlun, he has never been sent to the forbidden area, and the secrets of Kunlun Mountain are never mentioned. Cao Yi'an believes that Yunyangzi does not rely on and value him as much as he does on his senior brother Lu.</font>
story_75722_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Indeed, </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >the master wants you to go to the main hall immediately.</font>
story_75723_1=<font face="Default" color="#dd113a" >(A hint of coldness flashes in the eyes)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Disciple</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, recently there has been a traitor in our sect</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, and this treacherous person</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >is most likely hiding among the newly appointed</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >disciples</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font><font face="Default" color="#e50d2e" >(Suddenly focuses on you)</font>
story_75724_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Anyway, I won't hide it from you anymore... The head disciple is not in seclusion for healing, but has actually been missing for more than three days. This matter is most likely related to the Japanese.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The most urgent task</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > is for us to find him as soon as possible, otherwise the sect will surely be in chaos. - Oh, by the way, a few days ago, did you apply for the Mingxin Pill? If you're not injured or sick, why do you need that pill?</font>
story_75724_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Mingxindan is made from various precious herbs. If you take one, it's like having a piece of flesh cut out. Now, taking so many at once has cost me half my life! Sigh, is it worth it for two strangers, child...</font>
story_75724_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >We have already heard about the incident of Huamo Xun bringing Jiaping back to Kunlun. Our senior martial brother intended to use them to find out the details of the Japanese, but unfortunately, they have already infiltrated our sect.</font>
story_75724_4=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >For this matter, we still have to rely on the senior member of the Da Bie San.</font>
story_75725_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Don't panic, don't panic. I have already sent people to spread the news that you have the map of the Kunlun dragon veins. We just need to wait for the fish to take the bait.</font>
story_75726_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It turns out to be this kid Ding Moye, hmph, first lock him up,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >will slowly settle the score with him!</font>
story_75727_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >How did you find this place?</font>
story_75727_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Don't worry, take your time</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >and tell me.</font>
story_75727_3=<font face="Default" color="#e50d4a" >(A long silence)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >He...has returned?</font>
story_75727_4=<font face="Default" color="#ff0026" >（The voice trembles slightly）</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >......</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >That child was introverted and patient, always keeping things hidden in his heart. If he had spoken up back then, how could things have come to this!</font>
story_75727_5=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >For centuries, the barbarians have never given up their desire to destroy the dragon veins......</font>
story_75728_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >People are all amazed by the magnificence of Kunlun, but few know that there is an ancient dragon vein here, the source of all dragon veins in the world. As long as the ancestral dragon exists, peace will be maintained in the world. In other words, whoever possesses Kunlun, possesses the world.</font>
story_75728_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Throughout the history of this sect, the leaders have been known as the head, but in reality, they are the guardian of the ancestral dragon. For hundreds of years, the various foreign regions have never given up their desire to destroy our nation, and therefore they have been coveting the dragon veins. That is why the previous leader secretly created a fake dragon vein, also known as the protective dragon vein, in order to protect the true ancestral dragon. As disciples of Kunlun, we are willing to pay any price to protect the dragon veins, even if it means sacrificing our lives.</font>
story_75728_3=<font face="Default" color="#fc0720" >（She took the jade pendant, her hand trembling slightly, as if she understood everything）</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Since it was given by Jiaping, just keep it. You must have realized that the map in your hand marks the location of the dragon vein. If you follow the route shown on the map and reach the highest peak, you can also find the secret vault. However, what is hidden in this secret vault is not treasure, but enough explosives to level a mountain……</font>
story_75728_4=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It's time to put the dragon vein to use……but it will be difficult for you to pretend to defect and infiltrate the Japanese organization, waiting for the opportunity to press the trigger and detonate the explosives. This is a dangerous mission, and I'm afraid……</font>
story_75728_5=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Have you……thought it through?</font>
story_75728_6=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The jade pendant in your hand</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >is the key to detonating the explosive mechanism.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Simply place it in the hidden compartment of the secret vault, and within the time it takes to burn an incense stick, the explosives will detonate.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >During this time, you must quickly escape, or you will be blown to pieces.</font>
story_75729_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >No matter what punishment, I will accept it.</font>
story_75729_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >In a hidden crevice at the foot of Kunlun, it is extremely difficult for outsiders to detect.</font>
story_75730_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It's you! How did you find this place!</font>
story_75731_1=<font face="Default" color="#e2124d" >(Hands on your shoulders, glancing at you) </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >How do I know if this map is real or fake? How about...you lead the way ahead?</font>
story_75732_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I didn't mistake you, Jiaping is, and you are too!</font>
story_75732_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Sigh, it's time to bring Jiaping back...</font>
story_75733_1=<font face="Default" color="#ff0010" >（choking）</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >He's gone... After Jia Ping handed you the jade pendant, he couldn't hold on any longer... But before he passed away, he was briefly conscious. He smiled and said that although he couldn't complete the mission and face his master, he had found someone he could trust and could leave peacefully. I buried him at the foot of Kunlun Mountain, where he can rest forever and accompany his master and fellow disciples.</font>
story_75733_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >My friend, I will soon be leaving Kunlun. Thank you for your help, and if fate allows, we will meet again in the jianghu.</font>
story_75734_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Did he think he could forget everything by leaving? I won't be as weak as him. In the future, I will also become a brave and determined person!</font>
story_75735_1=<font face="Default" color="#ed1245" >（bitterly smiling）</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I heard that our master asked you to bring back our senior brother... I'm afraid I can no longer bear the title of "big senior brother" from you.</font>
story_75735_2=<font face="Default" color="#ea1748" >(Looks up at you suddenly, eyes full of disbelief)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...Where is Senior Lu buried? Can you take me to see?</font>
story_75736_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Ping'er, I was a step too late, I apologizes to you...</font>
story_75737_1=<font face="Default" color="#ff0010" >(With tears in his eyes, he bows three times)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Senior brother... junior brother has come to see you... I am ashamed, all these years I have complained about our master's favoritism and even secretly envied you. Now I understand, the difference between us is like night and day. But don't worry, senior brother, from now on I will show you a new Cao Yi'an, a true master of Kunlun</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >style</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font>
story_menu_75701=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Kunlun</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >martial arts</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >are renowned throughout the world, especially in regards to the way of</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >combat</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...</font>
story_menu_75702=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Greetings, senior brother, I am a newly admitted disciple.</font>
story_menu_75703=<font face="Default" color="#ff0228" >(Feeling guilty)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Cao senior brother, in our sparring I was careless and accidentally injured senior brother Jiang...</font>
story_menu_75704=<font face="Default" color="#f70e3d" >(Why is this elder bullying someone with a limp?)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Stop!</font>
story_menu_75705=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Senior brother, are you</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >alright?</font>
story_menu_75706=<font face="Default" color="#ed1749" >(Bowing)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master, I intervened without understanding the situation and delayed your treatment. I apologize...</font>
story_menu_75707=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Brother, is Master Gu Chenzi a very kind senior?</font>
story_menu_75708=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Junior brother, slow down. You seem out of breath...</font>
story_menu_75709=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >How dare you cause trouble here in the mighty Kunlun?</font>
story_menu_75710=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >That wanderer earlier was in a hurry...</font>
story_menu_75711=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >May I ask, are you Uncle Hua?</font>
story_menu_75713=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Is the strange person in front of us the one Uncle Hua wants to save?</font>
story_menu_75714=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Oh no!</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It's</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >the Japanese!</font>
story_menu_75715=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Why does the headmaster want to meet me?</font>
story_menu_75716=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I don't know who are you talking about, Sect Leader.</font>
story_menu_75717=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Waiter, did you hear about a man called Zhao Ziji?</font>
story_menu_75718=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master, the Han family from Xishan has already gone to the village of Moshe to seek revenge against Zhao Ziji.</font>
story_menu_75719=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >What is the matter, Master?</font>
story_menu_75720=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master, Elder Wang says that this secret medicine is extremely important and Kunlun must control it.</font>
story_menu_75721=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Senior brother,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I'm back.</font>
story_menu_75722=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Senior brother,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Were you looking for me?</font>
story_menu_75723=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Greetings, master.</font><font face="Default" color="#e01840" > (The eldest disciple says that the master is injured, but it seems that there is no serious problem at the moment, which is good.)</font>
story_menu_75724=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >What exactly happened?</font>
story_menu_75725=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Senior</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, as you may already know, there is a traitor among us</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >......</font>
story_menu_75726=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Senior, the traitor has been caught.</font>
story_menu_75727=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >we have finally found you</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >!</font>
story_menu_75728=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I'm sure you now have some understanding of the ancient dragon veins......</font>
story_menu_75729=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Junior brother, are you willing to redeem yourself through your actions?</font>
story_menu_75730=<font face="Default" color="#dd0d4f" >(Finally found......)</font>
story_menu_75731=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >So?</font>
story_menu_75732=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have fulfilled the mission as entrusted.</font>
story_menu_75733=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Where is Senior Lu?</font>
story_menu_75734=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Little apprentice, Hua Bo</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >has left Kunlun</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...</font>
story_menu_75735=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Senior brother...</font>
story_menu_75736=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Senior Lu</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >passed away a few days ago</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...</font>
story_menu_75737=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Senior Brother, this is where Senior Lu rests...</font>
storyinfo_75701=Answer Headmaster <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_kl_001" style="HLStype1">Yun Yangzi's</a> question
storyinfo_75702=Find Senior Brother <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_kl_004" style="HLStype1">Cao Yi'an</a> to learn about sect matters
storyinfo_75703=Inquire with <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_kl_004" style="HLStype1">Cao Yi'an</a>
storyinfo_75704=Question <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_klzyb_003" style="HLStype1">Strange Uncle</a>
storyinfo_75705=Ask if the <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_klzyb_004" style="HLStype1">lame disciple</a> is injured
storyinfo_75706=Ask <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_klzyb_003" style="HLStype1">Gu Chenzi</a>
storyinfo_75707=Listen to Senior Brother <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_klzyb_002" style="HLStype1">Jiang Qing</a> talk about past events
storyinfo_75708=Ask <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_klzyb_005" style="HLStype1">guard disciple</a>
storyinfo_75709=Go down the mountain to see who is causing trouble <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_klzyb_006" style="HLStype1">this time</a>
storyinfo_75710=Ask <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_klzyb_008" style="HLStype1">Hua Yuying</a>
storyinfo_75711=Listen to <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_klzyb_009" style="HLStype1">Hua Moxun</a> tell the story
storyinfo_75712=Ask <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_klzyb_009" style="HLStype1">Hua Moxun</a>
storyinfo_75713=Ask <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_klzyb_009" style="HLStype1">Hua Moxun</a>
storyinfo_75714=Ask <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_klzyb_009" style="HLStype1">Hua Moxun</a>
storyinfo_75715=Many things have happened recently, let's hear <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_kl_001" style="HLStype1">Master Yunyang</a> explain them one by one.
storyinfo_75716=Meet <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_kl_001" style="HLStype1">Yun Yangzi</a>.
storyinfo_75717=Look for <a href="findnpc_new,city02,WorldNpc01054" style="HLStype1">Yu Liang</a>
storyinfo_75718=Inform the headmaster <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_kl_001" style="HLStype1">Yunyangzi</a> of what is known, and follow the headmaster's instructions.
storyinfo_75719=Ask the headmaster <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_kl_001" style="HLStype1">Yunyangzi</a> what important matters he has to command.
storyinfo_75720=Report the discovery to the headmaster <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_kl_001" style="HLStype1">Yunyangzi</a>.
storyinfo_75721=Inform <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_kl_004" style="HLStype1">Cao Yi'an</a>.
storyinfo_75722=Inquire about important matters from <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_klzyb_011" style="HLStype1">Kunlun disciples</a>.
storyinfo_75723=Listen to <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_kl_001" style="HLStype1">Yunyangzi</a>'s account.
storyinfo_75724=Inquire from <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_klzyb_012" style="HLStype1">Guchenzi</a>.
storyinfo_75725=Inquire from <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_klzyb_013" style="HLStype1">Dabiesanren</a>.
storyinfo_75726=Listen to <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_klzyb_013" style="HLStype1">Dabiesanren</a>'s account.
storyinfo_75727=Go to the back mountain to find <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_klzyb_016" style="HLStype1">Yunyangzi</a>.
storyinfo_75728=Listen to <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_klzyb_016" style="HLStype1">Yunyangzi</a>
storyinfo_75729=Question <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_klzyb_017" style="HLStype1">Ding Moye</a>
storyinfo_75730=Flatter <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_klzyb_018" style="HLStype1">Japanese woman</a>
storyinfo_75731=Listen to <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_klzyb_018" style="HLStype1">Japanese woman</a> arrange
storyinfo_75732=Inform <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_kl_001" style="HLStype1">Yunyangzi</a>
storyinfo_75733=Ask <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_klzyb_009" style="HLStype1">Hua Moxun</a>
storyinfo_75734=Listen to <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_kl_007" style="HLStype1">Hua Yuying</a> talk
storyinfo_75735=Greet Senior Brother <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_klzyb_022" style="HLStype1">Cao Yi'an</a>
storyinfo_75736=Inform <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_kl_001" style="HLStype1">Yunyangzi</a>
storyinfo_75737=Comfort Senior Brother <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_klzyb_024" style="HLStype1">Cao Yi'an</a>
storymenu_75701_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I believe that those who practice martial arts all strive to be invincible in the world, but victory and defeat are temporary. From the moment one starts learning martial arts, they are in a constant struggle with their own beliefs. To have no thoughts is to have no attachments, to not be moved by emotions, one must stand on the path of righteousness. The path of martial arts is also the path of self-cultivation, only by achieving a noble character can one truly understand the meaning of martial arts. </font>
storymenu_75701_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >As a humble and inexperienced disciple, </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I ask for the master's guidance to correct any mistakes.</font>
storymenu_75701_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The right path for humanity is to treat the world as one's own. As long as the heavens and earth are not benevolent, the right path of humanity will be full of hardships. It may be difficult to walk the right path, but it is ultimately the path of righteousness. </font>
storymenu_75701_4=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I will keep this in mind. </font>
storymenu_75702_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff">I will ask.</font>
storymenu_75703_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I apologize for my impudence, I will go </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >get medicine for Senior Jiang.</font>
storymenu_75704_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Senior, with your profound skills, why do you bully a younger disciple with a leg injury?</font>
storymenu_75704_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >... </font><font face="Default" color="#e50d47" >... (approaches a young disciple nearby)</font>
storymenu_75705_1=<font face="Default" color="#e81740" >（It turns out that the senior is Gu Chenzi's）</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I acted recklessly...</font>
storymenu_75706_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I am ashamed.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master, I have come here</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >to ask for some medicine for my injuries.</font>
storymenu_75707_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I saw him</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >spar with a senior brother who had a leg injury,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >his moves were fierce and merciless, and I couldn't help but intervene.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Later,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I found out that our senior uncle had a different approach to treating him...</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I interrupted them, but he didn't seem angry</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font>
storymenu_75707_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Why would he do such a thing when everything was fine?</font>
storymenu_75707_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >What exactly happened to make senior brother act so out of character...</font>
storymenu_75708_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Something must have happened, let's go and see.</font>
storymenu_75709_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Three of the top ten villains were injured? My Kunlun disciple would never intentionally harm someone, there must be a reason behind this...</font>
storymenu_75709_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Senior brother's matter is an internal affair of our Kunlun sect, we cannot allow others to spread rumors!</font>
storymenu_75710_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...Junior sister, who is he?</font>
storymenu_75710_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Since you are father and daughter, why can't they talk to others? What secrets do you have?</font>
storymenu_75710_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...Don't worry, I'll think of a solution.</font>
storymenu_75710_4=<font face="Default" color="#e51b4a" >(smiling lightly)</font>
storymenu_75711_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Uncle Hua, you misunderstood. I was asked by Hua to bring you the Mingxin pill.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I am</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >willing to help.</font>
storymenu_75711_2=<font face="Default" color="#e2124d" >(So he was trying to save someone else)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I am happy to help.</font>
storymenu_75713_1=<font face="Default" color="#ff0010" >(exclaims in surprise)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >What?!</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >He is Senior Lu? How did he end up in such a state? I must quickly report to our master and senior brother, and find a way to save Senior Lu!</font>
storymenu_75713_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >What exactly happened? Uncle Hua</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, can you</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >tell us the truth?</font>
storymenu_75713_3=<font face="Default" color="#f90421" >(Kunlun Dragon Vein? First time hearing about it...)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >And then?</font>
storymenu_75713_4=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Was it you</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >who leaked the secret of the dragon vein to foreign forces?</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >!</font>
storymenu_75713_5=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >How despicable!</font>
storymenu_75713_6=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >If only you had realized earlier, Uncle Hua...</font>
storymenu_75713_7=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The Japanese are so cruel!</font>
storymenu_75713_8=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It has come to this, there's no need to be too sad.</font>
storymenu_75713_9=
storymenu_75714_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I've been out for a while,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >it's time for me to go back</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font><font face="Default" color="#fc0515" >(Huh? It seems like Senior Lu has a reaction, let me go check it out)</font>
storymenu_75715_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Tiger Roaring Villa? What can such a minor role do?</font>
storymenu_75715_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master, rest assured, I will not fail in the mission!</font>
storymenu_75716_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Did none of the masters manage to kill it?</font>
storymenu_75716_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff"> Yes! </font>
storymenu_75717_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Why are they looking for Zhao Ziji? </font>
storymenu_75717_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you for telling us, Waiter.</font>
storymenu_75718_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >What is your plan, Sect Leader?</font>
storymenu_75718_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I will go now as ordered.</font>
storymenu_75719_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >How do you know it, Master?</font>
storymenu_75719_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master, rest assured, I will not disappoint you.</font>
storymenu_75720_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Do you have a plan?</font>
storymenu_75720_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff"> Yes! </font>
storymenu_75721_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >……</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master, are you okay</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >?!</font>
storymenu_75721_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I heard some news when I went down the mountain this time... Do you still remember,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Senior Lu who was expelled from the sect ten years ago?</font>
storymenu_75722_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Very well</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font>
storymenu_75723_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...Master, are you suspecting me?</font>
storymenu_75724_1=<font face="Default" color="#e51651" >(Embarrassed)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Um...</font>
storymenu_75724_2=<font face="Default" color="#e8123d" >(It seems that Master Uncle has long known the whereabouts of the Mingxin Pill...)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master Uncle, it was wrong of me to act without permission. I will return double the medicinal materials needed for the Mingxin Pill in the future!</font>
storymenu_75724_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master Uncle, how can we expose the traitor?</font>
storymenu_75724_4=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Senior Da Bie... </font>
storymenu_75725_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...</font><font face="Default" color="#dd162d" >(Why did he choose me?)</font>
storymenu_75726_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master, the spy has been found. What should we do next?</font>
storymenu_75727_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master... I was given a map by Senior Dabie Sanren and Daoist Wuwei, and finally managed to find you by following the markings on the map.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >In the past few days, some things have happened within the sect.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Please return to the sect as soon as possible, Master.</font>
storymenu_75727_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...It was me who applied for the Mingxin Pill from Uncle Gu Chenzi, and gave it to... gave it to an outsider. That person is the biological father of Junior Sister Huayuying, Hua Moxun. He requested the Mingxin Pill in order to save Senior Lu Jiaping.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >——</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Lu Jiaping.</font>
storymenu_75727_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Brother Lu was once harmed by the Japanese and was poisoned. Those people forced him to hand over the key to the dragon vein within three days, otherwise he would lose his sanity and become a walking corpse. He had already decided to sacrifice himself and never revealed a word. When he returned to the sect, he just wanted to bid farewell to you and the other brothers, Master...</font>
storymenu_75727_4=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...Uncle Hua said that the reason why he brought Brother Lu back to Kunlun this time was because after his mind improved slightly, he often mentioned the sect. He must have been worried about it. Master, he was also a victim of the incident back then. The main culprit was those shameless Japanese!</font>
storymenu_75727_5=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master, the Japanese are cunning and deceitful. In order to achieve their goals, they not only cultivate spies in secret, but also disguise themselves as you. Fortunately, under the arrangement of the elders, their conspiracy was exposed.</font>
storymenu_75728_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >So that's why our sect's purpose is to protect the ancestor of the ten thousand mountains and preserve the source of the true dragon...</font>
storymenu_75728_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I believe Senior Lu is also the same.</font><font face="Default" color="#e51433" >(Thinking of the jade pendant that Lu Jiaping gave to me)</font><font face="Default" color="#e0184d" >Master, do you recognize this jade pendant?</font>
storymenu_75728_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master, what can I do for the sect now?</font>
storymenu_75728_4=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master, I'm not afraid, let me go.</font>
storymenu_75728_5=<font face="Default" color="#ff021b" >(Nodding firmly)</font>
storymenu_75728_6=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I</font> <font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >will remember it</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font>
storymenu_75729_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Do you know where the Japanese are hiding?</font>
storymenu_75729_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...Take me there.</font>
storymenu_75730_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I heard that you have been searching for the treasure of dragon veins, and I have come to offer my cooperation. However, after the matter is settled, I also want to have a share.</font>
storymenu_75731_1=<font face="Default" color="#e21635" >(without showing any emotion)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >What's wrong with that?</font>
storymenu_75732_1=<font face="Default" color="#ed0731" >(bowing)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It's the duty of me.</font>
storymenu_75732_2=<font face="Default" color="#e81232" >(surprised)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I'll take care of it right away.</font>
storymenu_75733_1=<font face="Default" color="#ff0010" >(deeply saddened)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Senior brother, oh senior brother, do you know, our master has sent me to bring you back home!</font>
storymenu_75733_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Uncle Hua, I hope you can come back and visit your junior sister often. She actually misses you in her heart.</font>
storymenu_75734_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...I believe he will come back.</font>
storymenu_75735_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...Lu Shixiong</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, has passed away.</font>
storymenu_75735_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master, please follow me.</font>
storymenu_75736_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master, please accept my condolences...</font>
storymenu_75737_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Brother Lu has passed away, but he would be comforted to hear your words.</font>
useiteminfo_75701=Combine <a href="TASK_ITEM,item_klzyb_007" style="HLStype1">half of a map</a>
useiteminfo_75702=Go to the <a href="findnpc_new,school25,EventNpc_lzy_tyhg_czxs001_a" style="HLStype1">damaged area</a> on the boat docked at the <a href="findnpc_new,school25,EventNpc_lzy_tyhg_czxs002" style="HLStype1">shore</a>, and use <a href="TASK_ITEM,useitem_lzy_tyhgrc002" style="HLStype1">tools</a> to repair the boat.
